W5ONg&oe=6B1054B6"}, "display_name": "AR Planes", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fly 17 legendary U.S. warplanes around your room in mixed-reality or experience them at actual size!  Fire guns, missiles, and bombs to destroy targets.\n\nAll models are finely-detailed and scaled to 1:48.  They have proportionally-accurate flight characteristics that are carefully tuned for living-room sized gameplay (air-density is thick like water, gravity adjusted, etc.)\n\nPlanes  included:\n\u2022 B-17G Flying Fortress\n\u2022 P-38J Lightning\n\u2022 P-51D Mustang\n\u2022 F4U-1C Corsair\n\u2022 F-86E Sabre\n\u2022 F-4C Phantom II\n\u2022 SR-71A Blackbird\n\u2022 F-14A Tomcat\n\u2022 F-15E Strike Eagle\n\u2022 A-10C Thunderbolt II\n\u2022 F-16C Fighting Falcon\n\u2022 F/A-18F Super Hornet\n\u2022 F-117A Nighthawk\n\u2022 YF-23\n\u2022 F-22 Raptor\n\u2022 F-35A Lightning II\n\u2022 B-21 Raider\n\nDesigned for a single controller:\n\u2022 Button A/X: next plane (long-press for menu)\n\u2022 Button B/Y: toggle weapons-mode (long-press to toggle scale)\n\u2022 Trigger: forward thrust\n\u2022 Thumbstick button: afterburner (if available)\n\u2022 Thumbstick: (model-scale) plane pitch/yaw, (full-scale) move player & snap-turn\n\u2022 Grip: grab plane\n\u2022 You can move/rotate up to twice as fast with a second controller.\n\nDestroyable targets are contained within your physical room if you scan it in Quest Environment setup, otherwise a generic space is used.", "short_description": "Fly 17 famous U.S. warplanes around your room in mixed-reality or explore them at actual size!  Fire guns, missiles, and bombs to destroy targets!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/arplanes/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035